{{!-- ONE SEASON ON A SIDEWAYS TIMELINE.

      The slide-deck shape: one axis line across the page, a node on it per season, and that
      season's cards hanging off the node on a short stalk -- above the line for one season, below
      it for the next (`above`, alternated by the view model), so neighbours never crowd each other.

      ⚠ THE NODE COMES FIRST IN THE DOM, whichever side its cards hang on. The grid places the cards
      in the top or the bottom row; a screen reader and the Tab key read the season's name and then
      what happened in it, in that order, every time.

      The axis itself is drawn by the node (a rule across its whole column), so the line stays
      continuous from season to season with nothing measured in script. Every node carries its own
      year chip (the shared heading).

      The stalk runs from the cards all the way to the node, however tall the row of nodes is
      (user, 2026-10-04): `--cards` marks a season that has any, since the empty list still holds
      the whitespace between its tags and so is never `:empty`.

      A YEAR SEPARATOR opens the season that starts a year (`startsYear`): a column of its own with
      the year's chip on the axis. NO RED RULE on this view (user, 2026-10-04: the sheet's tab is not
      the pop-out, whose swimlanes keep theirs). Its own column, so the list's `--timeline-hcols`
      (timeline.hbs) gives it one; the chip sizes it.

      AN AGE'S BARE YEAR (`ageMark`, timeline-view.js#withAgeMarks) is the separator alone: a year
      nothing is written in, opened so an Age's band has its year to lie under.

      Context: one period view-model (timeline-view.js#periodVM). --}}
{{#if startsYear}}
<li class="stonetop-timeline-hyear" data-year="{{year}}"{{#if ageMark}} data-age-mark{{/if}}>
	<h2 class="stonetop-timeline-hyear-node"><span class="stonetop-year-chip">{{yearLabel}}</span></h2>
</li>
{{/if}}
{{#unless ageMark}}
<li class="stonetop-timeline-hperiod {{#if above}}stonetop-timeline-hperiod--above{{else}}stonetop-timeline-hperiod--below{{/if}}{{#if entries.length}} stonetop-timeline-hperiod--cards{{/if}}" data-period="{{key}}"{{#unless undated}} data-year="{{year}}"{{/unless}}>
	<div class="stonetop-timeline-hnode">
		<div class="stonetop-timeline-hhead{{#if seasonClass}} {{seasonClass}}{{/if}}{{#if seasonNotes.length}} stonetop-timeline-head--notes{{/if}}">
			{{> "stonetop.timeline-period-head"}}
		</div>
	</div>
	<ol class="stonetop-timeline-cards stonetop-timeline-hcards">
		{{#each entries}}{{> "stonetop.timeline-card"}}{{/each}}
	</ol>
</li>
{{/unless}}
